+        // Preload the concrete, foundational ESM dependencies (react, react-dom, tabbable, bootstrap, and the
+        // active theme's design-system bundle) so that the browser can fetch them in parallel with page parsing
+        // rather than discovering them one import-graph level at a time.
+        // Note: These must be emitted *after* the import map. Browsers only honour an import map for bare
